    "reason": "The linked PR shows the only file changed was rfcs/0011-opentelemetry-tracing/README.md, which was added [ev-470c6560a1d8]. The PR describes itself as a \"Specification for fluxcd/notification-controller#1097\" with the area/rfc label [ev-b280728aa2ed]. So the changelog line [ev-0ac14f075687] records a design document being added to the repo, not tracing behaviour shipped in Flux 2.7.0. No product subject or change follows from it, so \"protocol-behavior opentelemetry-tracing added\" misreads the text.",
